unofficial fan-made reimplementation created for learning and demonstration
purposes. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by Jundroo, and it contains no
assets from the original games: every mesh, texture, sound and piece of music
in this repository is generated procedurally at runtime by the code in `src/`.
